      "created_at": "2021-05-01T15:15:03.207Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Topic revive because I’ve found a workaround. All the way at the bottom of each post (including this one), there is a pull down box marked “Watching” or “Normal”. If you click that, the last option is “Muted”, which hides it from Latest. It at least gives me the ability to say “Nope, don’t care about this part” at will.</p>",
